        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Milagi' ku'nguno ya lole na ki'sa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ku'du' wize u'v'e u'li'sambazya mmola zya wu'fi. Ku'du' wize u'v'e haki'mo na mukenagu'zi na ku'v'a musangi'lwa wa wu'fi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku'du' wize u'v'e u'li'wilonda na idale lya v'antu' mu ku'v'ezya wu'kenagu'zi. Ninga ku'du' wize wisangye na idale lya v'antu' aho u'li'fumya wu'sangi'lwa ha iv'anza ku' muhayo ninga gu'mo ki'gele ku'nyongania wu'yangu'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' ku'du' wize u'v'e na wu'hegela ku' mihayo zya mupi'na.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“U'lu' u'yi'sange ng'ombe ninga mpunda ya mwanisi wako yi'tagi'kile, yi'laku'dime ku'yi'su'v'ya ku' wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U'lu' u'yi'wone mpunda yakwe u'yo aku'gayile yi'gwile ha nsi' ku'no yi'li' na muligo gwayo, ku'du' wize u'yi'leke haho yi'gwile. Yi'laku'dime u'mugwasye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ku'du' wize u'nyonganie wu'yangu' u'wo wu'li'koov'iwa ku' mupi'na mugati' na musango gwakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wilige ku'le na mihayo zya wu'fi, ninga ku'du' u'v'awu'lage av'o v'ali' wu'du'hu' musango na v'a lole, ku'nguno ene nkasye mmuv'azi'zye lole u'yo mukenagu'zi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku'du' wize u'zumye ku'pokela ihongo, ku'nguno ihongo li'li'v'ahofuzya minso av'o v'ali'wona, na ku'nyongania mihayo zya v'antu' v'a lole.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ku'du' wize u'mwiwonelezye mugeni mwizi'li'zi, ku'nguno inywe v'eni'ki'li' mumanyile i'vyo yi'li' ku' mugeni mwizi'li'zi, ku'nguno ndi' muli' v'ageni ku' nsi' ya Misili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Milagi' ku'nguno ya lu'siku' lwa ki'suuho u'lo lu'li' Sabato",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“U'lahambe mbiyu' ha nsi' yako ku' itungo lya myaka mukaga, na ku'pandi'ka viliwa vyayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi mwaka gwa mupungati' u'laleke ku'gali'ma malale ki'gele gasuuhe, na v'antu' v'api'na mugati' na inywe v'asalale viliwa ku'fuma mu malale genago, nazyo ndimu zya mu ipolu zidi'me u'mo v'alav'e v'ali'lekela. U'lav'e u'li'v'ezya vyene vivyo mu migu'nda zyako zya mizabibu na zya mizeituni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ku' itungo lya nsiku' mukaga u'lav'e u'li'tu'mama mili'mo zyako. Ali'vi lu'siku' lwa mupungati' u'lav'e u'li'suuha, ki'gele ng'ombe yako na mpunda yako ziv'e zili'suuha, nawe mwana wa muzya u'yo wav'yali'lilwe ha lu'go lwako, haki'mo na mugeni, v'apandi'ke ki'suuho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U'yi'dime yose i'yo naku'wi'lile. U'leke ku'gakania ninga hadoo mina ga milungu zingi', ninga galeke ku'degelekwa ku'fuma ku' mulomo gwako.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Myanya zya ki'la mwaka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulungu wendeleyaga ku'yomba ati', “Mulav'e muli'mbezezya mwanya kali' kadatu' ku' ki'la mwaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muzidime nsiku' zya Mwanya gwa Migate I'zyo Zikatumba, na mulav'e muli'lya migate i'zyo zikatumba mugati' na nsiku' mupungati' ki'ti' i'vyo namulagi'li'zizye. Mulav'ezye vyeni'vyo ku' itungo i'lo li'tu'u'lilwe lya mwezi gwa Abibu, u'go gu'li' mwezi gwa kwandya, ku'nguno mwezi gwenu'go hu' gwene mwafuma ku' Misili. Ku'du' ize igele muntu' ninga yu'mo ha mbele yanne ali' makono du'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' mulav'ezye Mwanya gwa Lu'siku' lwa Lyi'mbu'la, ku' ntomolwa ya mili'mo zya mu migu'nda zinywe. Mulav'ezye Mwanya gwa Lu'siku' lwa Ku'kuminga ku' ndugo ya mwaka, aho mulav'e muli'kuminga viliwa vya makono ginywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'agosya v'ose v'alav'e v'ali'wikungania ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu kali' kadatu' ki'la mwaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ku'du' munfumi'zye magazi ga ki'taambo channe haki'mo na mugate u'go gu'tumbile, ninga maguta ga mutugo gwa lu'siku' lwa mwanya gwanne ku'du' mwize muv'e muli'wu'lekela mpaka ndiyu'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Hangi' ntomolwa ya ntangi'lo ya nsi' yako u'lav'e u'li'yi'leta mu nnumba yanne, ene Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wako.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ku'du' wize u'kasev'ye kadi'lana mu mav'eele gamwa nnina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ilagano lya ku'tongelelwa na malaika",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Lingagi, ene nu'mutu'ma malaika amutongelele av'e ku' mbele yinywe, ki'gele amusu'nge mu nzi'la na ku'mufila mpaka ku' lwandi' u'lo nakamwiv'aga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulamuku'zye na ku'mudegeleka i'cho alav'e ali'yomba. Ku'du' mwize mumutale, ku'nguno akasye amutondole wu'kenagu'zi winywe, ku'nguno namutu'mile ku' lina lyanne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi mbe mwize mumudegeleke visoga muzwi gwakwe, na ku'v'ezya gose ago nu'yomba, haho ene ndav'e ni' mwanisi wa v'anisi v'inywe, na ndav'api'i'nge av'o v'ali'mupi'i'nga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Malaika wanne alamutongelele ku' mbele yinywe na ku'mufikya ku' nsi' ya V'aamoli, V'ahiti, V'apelizi, V'akanaani, V'ahivi na V'ayebusi, nanne ndav'azimangu'zye v'ose v'enav'o. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U'leke ku'ziku'v'i'i'la milungu zyav'o ninga ku'zitu'mami'la, na ku'londa ki'ti'le chav'o. Ali'vi u'lazibomolange kabisa, na nhi'ngi' zyav'o zya mawe zya kwisengela u'laziv'elange mav'ale mav'ale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na inywe mulantu'mami'le ene Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe, nanne ndavidosye viliwa vinywe na minzi' ginywe. Hangi' ndamusini'zye malwile mugati' na inywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku'kasye ku'v'e na muki'ma wa ku'v'ipya mwitungo ninga mugu'mba mu nsi' yinywe. Nanne ndamuyali'le muv'e na wikalo wu'lihu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ndafile wov'a ha mbele yinywe, na ku'zihahya ki'la kabi'la i'zyo mulav'e muzifiki'i'la. Ndav'av'ezye v'anisi v'inywe v'ose v'agalu'ke na ku'mupeela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndatongezye mawugu ha mbele yinywe, ago galav'apeezye V'ahivi, V'akanaani na V'ahiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi nkasye mbasage v'antu' v'enav'o ku' itungo lya mwaka gu'mo, ku'nguno nsi' yi'lasigale yi'li' wu'du'hu' ki'ntu' na ndimu zya mu ipolu zilingi'he na ku'mutusya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndav'asage hado hado mpaka aho mulav'e mwingi'ha na ku'gelani'la ku'yi'tema nsi' yeni'yo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nanne ndamutu'u'li'le lu'v'i'mbi' lwinywe ku'lamuli'la ku' Nyanza ya Shamu mpaka ku' Nyanza ya Meditelania",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23:31",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ku' Ki'ebulania nyanza ya V'afilisiti",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", na ku'fumi'i'la ku' ibalangu' mpaka ku' mongo gwa Efulate. Ndav'atu'u'le v'ikazi v'a nsi' yeni'yo mu makono ginywe, na inywe mulav'asage v'ahafume ha mbele yinywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku'du' u'tu'u'le ilagano ninga li'mo nav'o ninga na milungu zyav'o. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku'du' mwize muv'azumi'zye kwikala mu nsi' yinywe, ku'nguno u'lu' muzitu'mami'le milungu zyav'o, nhana yi'lav'e ki'ti' mutego ku' winywe, na v'alamuv'ezye mumbezezye wu'kenagu'zi ene.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
